%N A396482 Number of undirected Hamiltonian paths in the n X n torus grid graph, reduced for symmetry (with rotations, reflections, and translations not counted as distinct).
%H A396482 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/TorusGridGraph.html">Torus Grid Graph</a>.
%e A396482 a(3) = 12: 3 symmetric cases:
%e A396482                                     :
%e A396482   X--+--+       X--+--+       X--+  +
%e A396482         |             |          |  |
%e A396482 ..+--+  +..     +--+--+     ..X  +  +..
%e A396482      |          |                |
%e A396482 ..X  +--+..     +--+--X     ..+--+  +..
%e A396482                                     :
%e A396482 plus 9 nonsymmetric cases:
%e A396482                                                                 :
%e A396482   X--+--+       X--+--+       X--+--+       X--+  X       X--+  +
%e A396482         |             |             |          |  |          |  |
%e A396482   +--X  +       +--+  +       X  +--+     ..+  +  +..   ..+  +  +..
%e A396482   |     |       |  |  |       |  |          |  |          |  |
%e A396482   +--+--+       X  +--+     ..+  +--+..   ..+  +--+..     X  +--+
%e A396482                                                                 :
%e A396482   X--+--+       X--+--+       X--+--+       X--+--+
%e A396482         |             |             |             |
%e A396482 ..+--+  +..   ..+  X  +..     X--+  +       +--+  +
%e A396482      |          |  |             |  |       |  |  |
%e A396482 ..+--+  X..   ..+  +--+..   ..+--+  +..   ..+  X  +..
